# AI project development guide

1. **Read first:** open and follow repo-root `AI_PROJECT_DEVELOPMENT_REFERENCE.md` end-to-end for the request.
2. **Field catalogs in §B / §D–§F are required** — use the listed columns/JSON keys; verify names against `src/integrations/supabase/types.ts` and `src/interfaces/Project.ts` before writing SQL or content.
